<< /AP << /N 210 0 R /R 211 0 R >> /C [ 1 .819611 0 ] /Contents (Mostly well done question. A lot wasted time by combining the 2 fractions together which wasn't necessary in this case.) /CreationDate (D:20210902140018+10'00') /F 28 /M (D:20210903084902+10'00') /NM (eda91192-e559-4a07-8fab-6451dfaca467) /Name /Comment /P 140 0 R /Popup 152 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:21.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Mostly well done question. A lot wasted time by combining the 2 fractions together which wasn't necessary in this case.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 1355.25 1938.27 1379.25 1962.27 ] /Subj (Sticky Note) /Subtype /Text /T (apayne2) /Type /Annot >>
