<< /AP << /N 210 0 R /R 211 0 R >> /C [ 1 .819611 0 ] /Contents (First step was generally well done. Some had problems with the simplification and tried to expand \(x+h\)^-1 which can't be done.\rOther's left of the word Lim at the start of each line until the substitution of h=0 could be made.) /CreationDate (D:20210902140220+10'00') /F 28 /M (D:20210903084912+10'00') /NM (cf89174d-6bff-4d06-930c-2bb8ba8c4913) /Name /Comment /P 140 0 R /Popup 154 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:21.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">First step was generally well done. Some had problems with the simplification and tried to expand \(x+h\)^-1 which can't be done.&#13;Other's left of the word Lim at the start of each line until the substitution of h=0 could be made.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 2045.68 937.522 2069.68 961.522 ] /Subj (Sticky Note) /Subtype /Text /T (apayne2) /Type /Annot >>
